### applying mac3 filter to the "filtered_strelka.vcf" file.
i am using vcf tools for filering as bcftools was giving error

vcftools --vcf filtered_strelka.vcf \
--mac 3 \
--recode \
--recode-INFO-all \
--out filtered_mac3

## What this does
--mac 3 // Keeps only variants where the minor allele count ≥ 3.

--recode // Writes a new filtered VCF.

--recode-INFO-all //Preserves INFO fields from the original VCF.

--out filtered_mac3 //Creates: filtered_mac3.recode.vcf
// filtered_mac3.recode.vcf - we get this vcf file

